<title>HUNGARY: Hungary int. reserves drop to $8.64 bln in Feb.</title>
<headline>Hungary int. reserves drop to $8.64 bln in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's international reserves dropped to $8,639.3 million in February from $9,047.8 million in January, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY  ($ million)</p>
<p>				     Feb 1997	  Jan 1997</p>
<p> International reserves	 8,639.3	   9,047.8</p>
<p>	Of which gold		  36.4		34.8</p>
<p>International reserves and</p>
<p>	other foreign assets   12,155.4	  12,720.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The NBH values gold at London market prices.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
